Jason Green speaks the most fluent English in our school.
Nearly everybody enters for‘Oral English Competition’ each year, but Jason wins every time.
Jim Smith’s vocabulary islarger than Jason’s.
Jim works harder than Jason and recites more words, but Jason cansing many English songs.
He has learnt a new song and has sung it to us.
I like English too, but I do not like hard work.
